3433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/greatest-films-all-time/directors-100-best\">\"Directors' 10 Greatest Films of All Time\"</a>. <i>Sight &amp; Sound</i>. British Film Institute. December 4, 2014.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Sight+%26+Sound&amp;rft.atitle=Directors%27+10+Greatest+Films+of+All+Time&amp;rft.date=2014-12-04&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bfi.org.uk%2Fsight-and-sound%2Fpolls%2Fgreatest-films-all-time%2Fdirectors-100-best&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AThe+Sight+%26+Sound+Greatest+Films+of+All+Time+2012\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFMatthews\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Matthews, Peter. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.bfi.org.uk/sight-and-sound/polls/greatest-films-all-time/vertigo-hitchcock-new-number-one\">\"Vertigo rises: the greatest film of all time?\"</a>. <i>Sight &amp; Sound</i>. BFI<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">23 March</span> 2020</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Sight+%26+Sound&amp;rft.atitle=Vertigo+rises%3A+the+greatest+film+of+all+time%3F&amp;rft.aulast=Matthews&amp;rft.aufirst=Peter&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bfi.org.uk%2Fsight-and-sound%2Fpolls%2Fgreatest-films-all-time%2Fvertigo-hitchcock-new-number-one&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AThe+Sight+%26+Sound+Greatest+Films+of+All+Time+2012\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation magazine cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/culture/richard-brody/sight-s-top-fifty-films\">\"Sight &amp; Sound's Top Fifty Films\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_New_Yorker\" title=\"The New Yorker\">The New Yorker</a></i>. 2012-08-01. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20230715072632/https://www.newyorker.com/culture/richard-brody/sight-s-top-fifty-films\">Archived</a> from the original on 2023-07-15.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+New+Yorker&amp;rft.atitle=Sight+%26+Sound%27s+Top+Fifty+Films&amp;rft.date=2012-08-01&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newyorker.com%2Fculture%2Frichard-brody%2Fsight-s-top-fifty-films&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AThe+Sight+%26+Sound+Greatest+Films+of+All+Time+2012\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160207035347/http://www.bfi.org.uk/films-tv-people/sightandsoundpoll2012/critics\">\"Critics' Top 100\"</a>. <i>Sight &amp; Sound</i>. British Film Institute. 2012. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.bfi.org.uk/films-tv-people/sightandsoundpoll2012/critics\">the original</a> on February 7, 2016.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Sight+%26+Sound&amp;rft.atitle=Critics%27+Top+100&amp;rft.date=2012&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.bfi.org.uk%2Ffilms-tv-people%2Fsightandsoundpoll2012%2Fcritics&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AThe+Sight+%26+Sound+Greatest+Films+of+All+Time+2012\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation news cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020816030430/http://www.bfi.org.uk/sightandsound/topten/poll/critics.html\">\"Critics Top Ten Poll 2002\"</a>. <i>Sight &amp; Sound</i>. British Film Institute. Archived from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.bfi.org.uk/sightandsound/topten/poll/critics.html\">the original</a> on August 16, 2002<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">May 10,</span> 2018</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Sight+%26+Sound&amp;rft.atitle=Critics+Top+Ten+Poll+2002&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.bfi.org.uk%2Fsightandsound%2Ftopten%2Fpoll%2Fcritics.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AThe+Sight+%26+Sound+Greatest+Films+of+All+Time+2012\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFBrown2012\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Brown, Mark (August 1, 2012). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/film/2012/aug/01/vertigo-hitchcock-bfi-greatest-film\">\"Vertigo tops greatest film poll, endi